  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Yakisoba uses pre-cooked wheat noodles tossed with pork belly, cabbage, and carrot over fierce heat to build "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "wok hei ",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "wok-hei"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". The dish is finished with "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "yakisoba sauce ",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "yakisoba-sauce"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", then topped with bonito flakes and pickled ginger. Serves 4."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Keep the heat as high as possible throughout and work quickly so the noodles char slightly rather than steam."
          }
        ]
      },
